@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

### Login: copia el token de la respuesta en @token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "TU_PASSWORD" }

############################ CLIENTES ############################

### Lista de clientes
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Un cliente
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar la dirección de un cliente
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "Obere Str. 58", "city": "Berlin" }

### Body vacío -> 400
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Cliente inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/customers/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

############################ PEDIDOS ############################

### Crear pedido con cliente nuevo
POST {{host}}/api/orders/with-customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newCustomer": { "customerName": "Bodega Miraflores SAC", "city": "Lima", "country": "Peru" },
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "shipperId": 2,
  "items": [ { "productId": 11, "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": 42, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Pedido sin stock -> 409 NW409 (no se guarda nada)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/with-customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 20, "warehouseId": 1, "items": [ { "productId": 11, "quantity": 9999 } ] }

### customerId y newCustomer a la vez -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/orders/with-customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 20, "newCustomer": { "customerName": "X" }, "warehouseId": 1, "items": [ { "productId": 11, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Detalle de un pedido
GET {{host}}/api/orders/10248
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pedidos de un empleado en 1997
GET {{host}}/api/orders?employeeId=4&from=1997-01-01&to=1997-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial de un cliente
GET {{host}}/api/orders/customer/20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar pedido (solo Admin): cambia el id por el que creaste
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/10444
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
